      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "fn",
      "rgn": "top",
      "pivotText": "Los Angeles 1947",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "88e80216-d625-40df-b873-356fcb08fbab": {
      "start": 5367,
      "end": 5446,
      "txt": " ليس هذه المرة. (صوت) ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Nah, not this time. ",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "8fa49596-b51f-4967-852e-8ea8e41de917": {
      "start": 8487,
      "end": 9140,
      "txt": "وبدأ يتساءل  \"كيف صعَد هناك؟ لا بد أنه متسلّق جبال.\" \nالأهم أنه قال إن الرجل كان غريباً. \nكان يبحث بأنحاء الصخرة  عن شيء أو شخص ما. ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "And he's thinking to himself, \"How the hell do you get up there? You got to be a goddamn mountain climber.\" But more importantly, he says the guy's acting really funny. He's looking all over that rock, like he's looking for something or someone.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "948a03d7-eeef-4a44-be16-1f37e93a6f63": {
      "start": 20622,
      "end": 20701,
      "txt": "يا نقيب أجب رجاءً. ",
      "characterId": "93fbd60e-8d5d-44e4-a2f6-3aba98c2902a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Captain, please come in!",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "953e2e70-db60-44ee-b0f7-b892b0155a43": {
      "start": 19840,
      "end": 19888,
      "txt": "إبقي معي .",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": " Hang on a minute.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "983fad40-c361-473d-8d6a-65575b2f6f9a": {
      "start": 31954,
      "end": 32032,
      "txt": "ارفعوا أيديكم الآن. ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Put your hands up now.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "9918014b-b15e-48b8-85a4-d7e31d19146a": {
      "start": 9212,
      "end": 9926,
      "txt": "وبتلك اللحظة، قال حلّ الظلام بشدة،  بسرعة وتحول الجو متفجراً  رعد وبرق، طقس لم يرَ مثله قطّ ولم يعلم من أين أتى. ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "At that very moment, he says it got really, really dark really fast and bombs start going off in the air. Thunder and lightning, weather like he'd never seen before, coming from he didn't know where.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "9d13f35b-6634-4f44-9a29-5893f72366b3": {
      "start": 11658,
      "end": 11799,
      "txt": "هذا كل شيء. هذه روايته. ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": " And that was it. That was his story, right?",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "9d154871-5369-4965-9015-e913bfcbbe49": {
      "start": 786,
      "end": 937,
      "txt": ".",
      "characterId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [
          "Annotation.PrinciplePhotography"
        ],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "HOLLYWOOD HOTEL",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "a25ea56f-20aa-4bc8-bee1-6a8f68ae63a0": {
      "start": 12878,
      "end": 12912,
      "txt": "شاهداً؟",
      "characterId": "9c514b7f-56ec-4a88-9a21-471104b8ad63",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "A witness?",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "a68d66cc-0a2c-406b-9181-7ef95586192c": {
      "start": 20107,
      "end": 20225,
      "txt": "نقيب \"فوستر\"، أجب من فضلك. ",
      "characterId": "93fbd60e-8d5d-44e4-a2f6-3aba98c2902a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Captain Foster, come in please.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "a6a95b2f-ed1f-4a8c-bf9e-f39269c058d0": {
      "start": 5491,
      "end": 5518,
      "txt": "ماذا تقصد ؟",
      "characterId": "9c514b7f-56ec-4a88-9a21-471104b8ad63",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "What do you mean?",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "a8c08113-090f-4add-a8e0-1dcf8068c737": {
      "start": 8161,
      "end": 8181,
      "txt": "أجل.",
      "characterId": "9c514b7f-56ec-4a88-9a21-471104b8ad63",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Yeah.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "a993d17b-bd12-4530-b59b-716651a29989": {
      "start": 32412,
      "end": 32638,
      "txt": "[صوت]",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "[REACTION]",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "a9ea1cbc-72d9-4ccd-9c70-5588b9961095": {
      "start": 13965,
      "end": 15547,
      "txt": "قال حلّ الظلام فجأة  وبسرعة   . رعد وبرق والطقس كان يزداد سوءًا.\nونظر للصخرة ، اختفى الرجل . \nلكن وجد امرأة. بفستان أبيض بشرتها  كالمرمر . وقد قال ، إنها كانت تحدّق به. \nلا أعرف ماذا أصدّق . \nانا لا أريد تصديقه. ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Then, it gets dark all of a sudden. Really fast. Like thunder and lightning from everywhere, all this weather. When he looks back at the rock... the guys gone, but there's a woman there in a long white dress with Alabaster skin. And she staring right up at him, not moving. I don't know what to believe. I know I sure don't want to believe him.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "ad8481d9-622d-4e08-9ec9-a5a925b25614": {
      "start": 3415,
      "end": 4063,
      "txt": "(صوت) . \nوفقا للتحريات. (صوت) \nلا، سجلات إجرامية أو صلة بأي منظمات إجرامية. اعتقل أحدهم للقيادة ثملا منذ فترة .  ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF_ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Mm-mm. I mean, I checked them all out. There's no criminal records. No association with any criminal organizations. One of the guys was arrested for drunk driving a long time ago.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "b2d6c6f3-f3d1-40f9-a87c-614548130996": {
      "start": 6081,
      "end": 6096,
      "txt": "[صوت]",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "[REACTION]",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "b624e2c7-42f9-4ff3-9412-eb1348c5e81a": {
      "start": 7181,
      "end": 7222,
      "txt": "ماذا قال؟",
      "characterId": "9c514b7f-56ec-4a88-9a21-471104b8ad63",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "What did he say?",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "c1eaf7af-322e-48a0-8613-ac5301feb9d9": {
      "start": 2717,
      "end": 3250,
      "txt": "ليس المافيا ؟ ، الأمر مختلف . أحدهم معلم في مدرسة . و الثاني مسؤل مبيعات . و الأخير كان متقاعدا",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [
          "Annotation.Context"
        ],
        "text": "Mob hits: people killed by the mob/mafia."
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON_OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Mob hits? Nah, not this time. One of these guys was a schoolteacher. Next guy, he sold insurance. Last guy, he was retired.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "ca77fdad-3c46-4013-b700-57a2965b294f": {
      "start": 6549,
      "end": 6599,
      "txt": "تصدّقه الآن؟",
      "characterId": "9c514b7f-56ec-4a88-9a21-471104b8ad63",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "And now you believe him?",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "ca9602c3-c255-46c9-b177-afeda9410951": {
      "start": 4171,
      "end": 4251,
      "txt": "كانوا جميعا مطلقين. ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": " They were all divorced. ",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "d5ed8427-2985-43db-8774-a40f22b64367": {
      "start": 20488,
      "end": 20541,
      "txt": "نقيب \"فوستر\"؟",
      "characterId": "93fbd60e-8d5d-44e4-a2f6-3aba98c2902a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Captain Foster?",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "dba711b4-4e1c-49e2-8c3a-ebab70e1fecb": {
      "start": 6306,
      "end": 6478,
      "txt": "ظننته مجنونًا بسبب، ما قاله...",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [
          "Annotation.Context"
        ],
        "text": "Nuts: crazy."
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Because I thought the guy was nuts. What he said...",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "def71a09-4896-411a-9130-c5effbead965": {
      "start": 2258,
      "end": 2289,
      "txt": "بالضبط",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "That's right.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "dfede135-d444-4285-a897-d9cfa5fb5489": {
      "start": 19318,
      "end": 19474,
      "txt": "سألقي نظرة  قبل أن ترسلوا أحدًا  لذا...",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Listen, I'm going to take a look around before you send anybody out here. So--",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "ecba6e8a-43f1-4bbc-9193-635001aadebd": {
      "start": 18690,
      "end": 19072,
      "txt": "الطوارئ، أنا النقيب \"فوستر\". \nانا في \"الماتادور\" ولا أثر/   للمحقق \"سوليفان\". ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Yeah, dispatch, this is Captain Foster. I'm out here at the El Matador location. There's no sign of Detective Sullivan.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "f0341d79-fcdd-44f4-9a57-e7c87d9d6a3f": {
      "start": 8214,
      "end": 8445,
      "txt": "أياً كان  رأى رجلًا هناك،  فوق تلك الصخرة. ",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF_ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "Anyway, he looks down there and there's a guy who's on top of that rock.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    },
    "fed7a211-202f-4f1a-90bc-91dd747dfcb9": {
      "start": 4597,
      "end": 4807,
      "txt": "هل تمزح ؟ \nفي هذه الحالة لا تذهب أنت إلى هناك .",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": "",
      "pivotText": "What are you, a comedian? If that's the case, you sure don't want to go out there.",
      "pivotStyles": []
    }
  },
